# Web3Forms access key for the contact form. Get one by entering your email at
# https://web3forms.com, then copy the key they send you. Locally, put it in
# .env.local; on Vercel, add it under Project Settings, Environment Variables.
#
# The form also carries an hCaptcha. Web3Forms runs that check for free, so
# there is no second key to set, but the captcha only counts once you turn it on
# for this form in the Web3Forms dashboard: open the form and pick hCaptcha
# under the spam settings. Until then the widget still renders and the
# submissions are only filtered by the honeypot.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
